{
	"name": "Menacing Glare",
	"type": "maneuver",
	"img": "icons/magic/unholy/hand-claw-glow-orange.webp",
	"system": {
		"description": "<p>As you strike one target down, your eyes fall upon a new victim. When you reduce a creature to 0 hit points, or strike a creature already at 0 hit points to force a death saving throw, you may use your reaction to choose a creature within 60ft. This target must make a Wisdom saving throw or become [[/condition id=rattled]] until the end of your next turn. If you have one or more curse effects active on the creature before they reach 0 HP you may transfer those curses to the target of your Menacing Glare at no additional cost.</p>",
